WEBVTT

00:06:27.594 --> 00:06:31.526
"Oh, I'm overworked,
because I have to answer emails all day."

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.836
AHP: I mean, I don't think that that means

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:40.546
that you necessarily have
the same amount of acute stress.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.111
I mean, a social media manager

00:06:42.135 --> 00:06:44.986
also has to deal
with a whole bunch of racist shit

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.076
being flung at them all day.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:51.501
This is accumulation of decades of stress.

00:06:51.525 --> 00:06:54.596
And there doesn't seem
to be an end in sight.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:59.602
(Music)

00:06:59.626 --> 00:07:02.667
AG: Wherever you draw the line
on what counts as burnout,